  "articleBody": "It's frustrating when your kitchen, the heart of your home, just doesn't work for you anymore, isn't it? Maybe you’re tripping over each other, or you can never find enough counter space. This isn't just about appearances; a dysfunctional kitchen can seriously impact your daily life and even your home's value. But how do you know when it’s gone from mildly annoying to truly needing a major overhaul?\n\nOne common sign is a poor layout. If your sink, stove, and refrigerator aren't in a practical layout, we can help you optimize this space depending upon your needs.",
